==Battleground==
*1 [[Lord Gravey]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*3 [[Chickful A]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
*6 [[Zroco]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*10 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*3 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a fairly basic Lord Gravey stage with waves of peons. Use your first Holy Blast to chip away at Lord Gravey and use your next three to unburrow each Zory and get them to take massive damage. [[Housewife Cat]] with her [[Talents]] is extremely strong here, being able to Slow Lord Gravey and hit super powerful Savage Blows against the supporting Angel enemies. Make sure to run something for Miz Devil like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime]] as well.

